  silentWhenLocked: 0
  lockedLines:
  - Nope
  mainLines:
  - "You all love stories\u2026"
  - "But that wasn\u2019t one."
  - It was a brother and a sister.
  - Poor. Lost.
  - They came here looking for family.
  - They found a car instead.
  - She died.
  - He survived.
  - Later I found out who they were.
  - They are my Distant cousins.
  - I let the brother go.
  - And I lost my badge for it.
  - If someone really wants the truth
  - "I can\u2019t hide it"
  - Take the mask on and go to the police station for it
